@startuml 10_sequence_ptp
!theme plain
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 5

skinparam participant {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BorderColor #0284C7
    FontColor #0F172A
    FontSize 11
}

skinparam actor {
    BackgroundColor #EFF6FF
    BorderColor #1E40AF
    FontColor #0F172A
    FontSize 11
}

' ==============================================================================
' SUMBER IMPLEMENTASI:
' 1. routes/web.php (Route::get('/ptp-monitoring', [PtpMonitoringController::class, 'index']), Route::get('/ptp-monitoring/export', [PtpMonitoringController::class, 'export']))
' 2. app/Http/Controllers/PtpMonitoringController.php
' 3. resources/views/ptp-monitoring/index.blade.php
' ==============================================================================

actor "Tim Collection / AR Agent" as User
participant "Browser" as Browser
participant "PtpMonitoringController" as Controller
database "MySQL Database" as DB

User -> Browser: Buka menu "PTP Monitoring" (opsional isi filter tanggal / AR Agent)
activate Browser
Browser -> Controller: GET /ptp-monitoring?search=...&ar_agent_id=...&date_from=...
activate Controller

Controller -> DB: Visit::with(['customer', 'arAgent'])\n  ->where('is_ptp', true)\n  ->latest('tanggal_input')\n  ->paginate(20)
activate DB
DB --> Controller: Return 20 baris data PTP paginated

Controller -> DB: Hitung KPI (totalPtp, todayPtp, ptpWithPhoto, ptpRate)
DB --> Controller: Return agregasi KPI

Controller -> DB: ArAgent::orderBy('name')->get()
DB --> Controller: Return daftar AR Agent untuk dropdown filter
deactivate DB

Controller --> Browser: Render view ptp-monitoring/index.blade.php (Data PTP, KPI, Filter Form)
deactivate Controller
Browser --> User: Tampilkan dashboard PTP Monitoring

== Alur Ekspor Data PTP ke CSV ==

opt Pengguna Mengekspor Data
    User -> Browser: Klik tombol "Export CSV"
    Browser -> Controller: GET /ptp-monitoring/export (dengan query filter)
    activate Controller
    Controller -> DB: Query seluruh data PTP sesuai filter aktif
    activate DB
    DB --> Controller: Return kumpulan data PTP
    deactivate DB
    Controller --> Browser: Stream response text/csv (UTF-8 BOM Header: attachment; filename="export-ptp-*.csv")
    deactivate Controller
    Browser --> User: Download file CSV ke komputer lokal
end

@enduml
